@startuml eof-questionnaire-sequence-p2
title EOF questionnaire - Page 2/3 : generate and send, outside the pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E0F0F4
  BorderColor #5BA1BC
  FontColor #1C2856
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E0F0F4
  BorderColor #5BA1BC
  FontColor #1C2856
}
skinparam ArrowColor #5BA1BC
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5BA1BC
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #ECECF2
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #5BA1BC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #E0F0F4
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9BD0DD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Auditor" as U #82C1DD
participant "Claude\n(skill analyse-parcours)" as C #82C1DD
participant "generate_questionnaire.py" as GQ #DBDDE5
actor "Audited service\nteam" as I #C8E6C9
database "audit-dir/" as FS #9BD0DD

note over U, FS
  WARNING. NOTHING ON THIS PAGE IS AUTOMATIC.
  No audit step calls this script: it is a
  command to type, after reading the page 1/3 report.
end note

== Generate the questionnaire ==

U -> C : Request the questionnaire
C -> GQ : python3 generate_questionnaire.py <audit-dir>
GQ -> FS : Read eof-audit-results.json
FS -> GQ : Criteria already settled by measurement
GQ -> GQ : Keep only the criteria without an answer,\nand those answered "to be assessed"
GQ -> GQ : Sort by decreasing yield:\nmulti-criterion questions first
GQ -> FS : questionnaire-eof.md\n(62 questions at most)
GQ -> C : The real count is lower:\na well-measured site gets about 55

note over GQ, FS
  ONE SINGLE file. The split into two, product and
  technical, was removed: it routed nothing.
  3 recipients out of 4 received questions in
  BOTH files.

  Each question says in its title who to ask:
  the product manager, the development team,
  the person operating the infrastructure, the one
  managing the data. It is an indication, not a
  filing plan: roles depend too much on each client.

  The order follows the yield: a client who stops
  halfway has covered the maximum number of criteria
  for the effort provided. The yield is calculated over
  the REMAINING criteria, so a block whose measurement
  already settled part of it drops back on its own.

  Format: Markdown checkboxes, with hidden
  markers in HTML comments so that the read-back does
  not depend on the layout.
  An "I don't know" box is always offered, and
  it never produces an answer.
end note

C -> U : File path

== Send, wait, receive ==

U -> I : Transmit the file

note over U, I
  WAITING. The delay is asynchronous and not tooling-backed.
  Nothing in the code sets a deadline, reminds
  the contact, or tracks who answered what.
  The transport is free: email, shared drive,
  whatever the client accepts.
end note

I -> I : Tick the boxes,\neach the questions that concern them
I -> U : Send back the filled-in file
U -> FS : Put the filled-in file back\nin the audit directory

note over U, FS
  The file must come back under its original name, in the
  audit directory: that is where the read-back looks for it.

  If it does not come back, the read-back says so: it sets a
  read_error state that the probe health check
  catches. A questionnaire never returned therefore no
  longer looks like an empty returned questionnaire.
  Continued: page 3/3.
end note

@enduml
